# 🤖 RAG Community Matchmaker

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.11-blue)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.116-green)
![LangChain](https://img.shields.io/badge/LangChain-RAG-yellow)
![Pinecone](https://img.shields.io/badge/Pinecone-VectorDB-blueviolet)
![Groq](https://img.shields.io/badge/Groq-LLM-red)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-Frontend-orange)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-lightgrey)

An AI-powered teammate recommendation platform that uses **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** to match students, hackathon participants, and professionals based on skills, interests, and experience.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔍 Semantic teammate search using vector embeddings
- 🤖 AI-generated teammate recommendations
- ⚡ FastAPI backend
- 🌲 Pinecone vector database
- 🦜 LangChain RAG pipeline
- 🧠 Sentence Transformer embeddings
- 💬 Groq Llama 3 integration
- 🎨 Streamlit frontend
- 📄 Swagger API Documentation

---

## 🏗️ Tech Stack

| Category | Technology |
|----------|------------|
| Backend | FastAPI |
| AI Framework | LangChain |
| Embeddings | Sentence Transformers |
| Vector Database | Pinecone |
| LLM | Groq Llama 3 |
| Frontend | Streamlit |
| Language | Python 3.11 |

