## ⚙️ Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/RAG-Community-Matchmaker.git

cd RAG-Community-Matchmaker

python -m venv .venv

source .venv/bin/activate
```

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
```

Run API

```bash
python backend/run.py
```

Open

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

---

## 🧠 How it Works

1. User submits profile
2. Profile converted into vector embedding
3. Stored inside Pinecone
4. User requests teammate recommendations
5. Similar profiles retrieved
6. LangChain + Groq generate the best matches

